        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOB RECRUITMENT: FOREST OFFICER</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Job Payment:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>$500 / Night Shift</strong><br><i>Terms &amp; Conditions: Only valid if employee survives the entire shift.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Job Description:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surveillance</strong>: Monitor all forest cameras.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense</strong>: Prevent cannibals from breaching cabin gates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feeding Duty</strong>: Deliver “FOOD” into the well whenever you hear crying.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Duties:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair security systems during interference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor generator power and refill fuel as needed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>UV flashlight</strong> to repel cannibals — their skin burns under it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skills Required:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic computer knowledge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prior experience with horror games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to carry heavy packages (<i>bodies</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Must not be afraid of the dark… <i>too much</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cannibal Behavior Report:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cannibal follows a different path to approach you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can <strong>hide in the dark</strong> (use your flashlight).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can <strong>lurk beneath cameras</strong> (listen for breathing).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can <strong>sabotage cameras and other systems.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more…</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Disclaimer:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This job contract is <strong>legally and spiritually binding.</strong><br>Resignation before completing the <strong>3-night shift</strong> is strictly prohibited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><i><strong>If you fail to feed the cannibals, then you need to feed yourself.</strong></i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOB RECRUITMENT: FOREST OFFICER</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Job Payment:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>$500 / Night Shift</strong><br><i>Terms &amp; Conditions: Only valid if employee survives the entire shift.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Job Description:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surveillance</strong>: Monitor all forest cameras.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense</strong>: Prevent cannibals from breaching cabin gates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feeding Duty</strong>: Deliver “FOOD” into the well whenever you hear crying.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Duties:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair security systems during interference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor generator power and refill fuel as needed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>UV flashlight</strong> to repel cannibals — their skin burns under it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skills Required:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic computer knowledge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prior experience with horror games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to carry heavy packages (<i>bodies</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Must not be afraid of the dark… <i>too much</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cannibal Behavior Report:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cannibal follows a different path to approach you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can <strong>hide in the dark</strong> (use your flashlight).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can <strong>lurk beneath cameras</strong> (listen for breathing).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can <strong>sabotage cameras and other systems.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more…</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Disclaimer:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This job contract is <strong>legally and spiritually binding.</strong><br>Resignation before completing the <strong>3-night shift</strong> is strictly prohibited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><i><strong>If you fail to feed the cannibals, then you need to feed yourself.</strong></i></p>",
        "short_description": "A survival horror where you monitor cameras, manage power, and deliver bodies to a cannibal well. Use your UV flashlight to repel cannibals stalking the forest at night. Survive two shifts—or become the feast.",
